      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔥 What if we REMOVE stopPropagation()?\n\nThen clicking the button will trigger:\n\n✔ Button alert\n✔ Toolbar alert\n✔ Body listeners\n✔ Document listeners\n\n\n",
